<title>CANADA: NuGas files to buy back 5 pct of shares.</title>
<headline>NuGas files to buy back 5 pct of shares.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>NuGas Ltd said on Thursday it received approval to buy back up to 785,315, or five percent, of its common shares through a normal course issuer bid.</p>
<p>NuGas said the bid would start on January 27, 1997 and end January 26, 1998 unless terminated or completed by the company.</p>
<p>The company said its share price from time to time may not reflect the stock's underlying value.</p>
<p>It also said that it purchased 102,500 shares under a previous issuer bid which expired in November.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
